          "code": "RULE:PRO-003",
          "severity": "warning",
          "path": null,
          "message": "No guardrail metrics declared. Declare at least one guardrail with its harmful direction and a tolerance, for example a refund rate that must not rise by more than 10% relative."
        },
        {
          "code": "RULE:DES-009",
          "severity": "info",
          "path": null,
          "message": "The cohort check of the results review would not run on this plan. If an effect that differs between the weeks players joined could matter for this change, plan at least 21 days (42 days or more allows blocks of 14 days, which need fewer players a week), bring in more eligible units each day or give the smaller arm a larger share, keep the arms within 9 to 1, and randomise and analyse in the same independent unit (player, user or device). The evidence gives the units a day that pass with even arrivals; allow more, because arrivals vary (design section 21.6: spiky arrivals need 1.5 to 3 times as much). Otherwise accept that the cohort check will not run: the other results checks are not affected."
        },
        {
          "code": "RULE:PRO-004",
          "severity": "info",
          "path": null,
          "message": "Bucketing salt not declared. Set procedure.bucketing_salt to a value unique to this experiment, for example its id."
        }
      ],
